 "title": "Smooth projective curves",
 "statement": "Let $k$ be a field. A *smooth projective curve over $k$* is a\ncurve $X$ over $k$ such that $X\\to\\operatorname{Spec}(k)$ is\nsmooth and\nprojective. In Stacks Project,\nChapter 44 (Picard Schemes of Curves) the phrase *smooth projective\ncurve over $k$* is used in exactly this sense;",
